   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guatemala Drought ACF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Guatemala Drought ACF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACF will respond the Prolonged Food and Nutrition Crisis 09-10 by Restoring Agricultural Livelihoods in the Dry Corridor of Guatemala and rehabilitate Rural Livelihoods of the Population Affected by the Storm Agatha. ACF will also provide basic services and improve access to income for the most vulnerable, with focus on WASH and agriculture.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACFs insats svarar p&#xe5; den utdragna matkrisen pga torka under 09-10 genom att behandla undern&#xe4;rda barn och rehabilitera  f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rningsf&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan bland befolkningen som drabbats av stormen Agatha. ACF kommer ocks&#xe5; tillhandah&#xe5;lla grundl&#xe4;ggande service och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillg&#xe5;ngen till inkomster f&#xf6;r de mest utsatta 10-11, med fokus p&#xe5; tillg&#xe5;ng till rent vatten samt jordbruk.</narrative>
  </description>
